  "section_notes": "The S2 final text sets a 7% permanent per-model failure ceiling with no sales stop, only notification and corrective action above 5%, which protects Northwind's Hearth 10 (6.2%). S5 sets the mandatory recall trigger at 10 per 100k, with corrective action open-ended between 8 and 10, which protects Halcyon's Ember 8 (9.9%). Because the no-sales-stop provision has no stated end, S2 transition_months is coded 999 as an interpretive choice; the text does not say when sales must stop."
